ail.com","name":"henil suchak"},"message":"fix(simulation): fully integrate custom UI topologies and resolve queue deadlocks\n\n* Fixed TrainingQueueService to correctly forward the user''s graphJson to the background training queue instead of falling back to default dumbbell.\n* Integrated nlohmann/json.hpp into sim_inference.cc and sim.cc to dynamically parse and build arbitrary visual node/edge topologies.\n* Added deadlock protection in inference_svc.py and training_svc.py by parsing the topology payload for SAC agents; fails gracefully if user submits a disconnected graph or omits an RL agent.\n* Refactored inference_svc.py to run the synchronous Python RL agent loop inside a multiprocessing.Process so it can be terminated if the C++ binary exits early.\n* Reduced train_sac.py WebSocket streaming interval from 500 steps to 50 steps for nearly instantaneous UI graphing.","tree":{"sha":"80ff0bb65e489837e09f14cb608b10ae73f4f29d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/henil-suchak/Adaptive-Congestion-Control/git/trees/80ff0bb65e489837e09f14cb608b10ae73f4f29d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/henil-suchak/Adaptive-Congestion-Control/git/commits/234d3f0a912b5a2f0bc3e94cb6327020ead7090e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/201881339?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/henil-suchak/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/henil-suchak/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/henil-suchak/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/henil-suchak/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/henil-suchak","id":201881339,"login":"henil-suchak","node_id":"U_kgDODAh2-w","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/henil-suchak/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/henil-suchak/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github