:{"date":"2026-08-17T06:49:12Z","email":"1983531544@qq.com","name":"wl"},"message":"refactor(ci): 优化CI流程及生成项目依赖管理\n\n- 移除ci.yml中full-matrix任务的超时限制，确保完整执行\n- publish.yml中安装依赖改为使用--frozen-lockfile选项保证锁文件一致\n- 新增发布流程中包含法律组合测试(full-matrix)作为必要依赖\n- 测试阶段新增legal-combination分片任务，覆盖所有合法组合，确保质量门禁\n- 解绑bump-version和release任务与full-matrix的依赖，改为条件判断执行\n- 生成项目源码中取消黑盒依赖@moluoxixi/ajax-package，改用内置Axios源码\n- 更新package.json依赖，移除@moluoxixi/ajax-package，新增axios\n- 调整生成项目测试，新增对透明源码文件和axios依赖的断言覆盖\n- 修改Vue元素样式引入，使用官方主题入口，取消自定义色彩配置\n- 修改React模板，增加带子菜单的多层级菜单示例，并使用ConfigProvider设置布局主题\n- Vue模板SubMenu组件改为computed计算路由树，支持parentPath，优化递归和树结构构建\n- e2e测试新增无ESLint项目来源代码质量lint检查，确保全部合法组合均执行lint任务\n- 统一commit提示中显示透明源码及可选依赖信息，明确项目依赖状态\n- 更新测试工具，增加透明源码文件列表，辅助测试断言完整性\n- 修正测试用例substring相关匹配，替换@moluoxixi/ajax-package为axios并匹配源码调用\n- playwright测试改进菜单导航路径，模拟用户逐层展开点击三级菜单子项，增强测试覆盖","tree":{"sha":"68e9e56acce2b50cd3d29e144b0736b9416fe5a2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/moluoxixi-template/vite-cli/git/trees/68e9e56acce2b50cd3d29e144b0736b9416fe5a2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/moluoxixi-template/vite-cli/git/commits/ca58f8103cad48946721c2eb3e50dcf4a53d2e79","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/57121471?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/moluoxixi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/moluoxixi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/moluoxixi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/moluoxixi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/moluoxixi","id":57121471,"login":"moluoxixi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3MTIxNDcx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/moluoxixi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/moluoxixi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/moluoxixi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.gith