r to App Insights via openTelemetryConfiguration (#86)\n\n- Add appInsightsConfiguration and openTelemetryConfiguration to the\n  Microsoft.App/managedEnvironments resource in infra/infra.bicep, routing\n  OTLP traces and logs to App Insights at the ACA environment level\n- Bump managedEnvironments API version to 2024-10-02-preview (required for\n  appInsightsConfiguration support)\n- Add appinsights_infra_outputs_appInsightsConnectionString param to infra/infra.bicep\n  and wire it from appinsights_infra.outputs.appInsightsConnectionString in main.bicep\n- Add ProvisioningParameter in ConfigureInfrastructure (Program.cs) so aspire publish\n  auto-generates the param declaration and main.bicep wiring on re-publish\n- Remove UseAzureMonitor() SDK exporter from Extensions.cs — the ACA-managed collector\n  now handles telemetry routing to App Insights, eliminating duplicate telemetry\n- Remove Azure.Monitor.OpenTelemetry.AspNetCore and Azure.Identity package references\n  from MfePortal.ServiceDefaults.csproj as they are no longer needed","tree":{"sha":"a368665b1968f9252fedfa7a0ff991f067f292b4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aknagar/mfe-portal/git/trees/a368665b1968f9252fedfa7a0ff991f067f292b4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aknagar/mfe-portal/git/commits/d52c6e06816ab197737dcb20b3e33e0d1ce47636","verification":{"payload":"tree a368665b1968f9252fedfa7a0ff991f067f292b4\nparent 03c9109012def23b1898b08647edb80b6e1ffec2\nauthor aknagar <35679913+aknagar@users.noreply.github.com> 1775908042 +0530\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1775908042 +0530\n\nfeat: wire ACA-managed OTel collector to App Insights via openTelemetryConfiguration (#86)\n\n- Add appInsightsConfiguration and openTelemetryConfiguration to the\n  Microsoft.App/managedEnvironments resource in infra/infra.bicep, routing\n  OTLP traces and logs to App Insights at the ACA environment level\n- Bump managedEnvironments API version to 2024-10-02-preview (required for\n  appInsightsConfiguration support)\n- Add appinsights_infra_outputs_appInsightsConnectionString param to infra/infra.bicep\n  and wire it from appinsights_infra.outputs.appInsightsConnectionString in main.bicep\n- Add ProvisioningParameter in ConfigureInfrastructure (Program.cs) so aspire publish\n  auto-generates the param declaration and main.bicep wiring on re-publish\n- Remove UseAzureMonitor() SDK exporter from Extensions.cs — the ACA-managed collector\n  now handles telemetry routing to App Insights, eliminating duplicate telemetry\n- Remove Azure.Monitor.OpenTelemetry.AspNetCore and Azure.Identity package references\n  from MfePortal.ServiceDefaults.csproj as they are no longer needed","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJp2jTKCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAZRQQAFfhFPKdGSCi6P52j4W6dYJZ\nQAm/k2kK8IzmL5cCmNZjXT9Cmk6t4LSTKqk1JAPioDNsqlz3Zi6qhtCxuUCYbOAM\nBNyTOJYDTxBmwgbD+nfypMg3A4Z8pn5Rdrf0Hz88X80ra3bwbEL2qOcZj7MZRg5k\njCAt6f/2NuPZBvyPtpjcbI/BKIwT/QCF5J+YF0VLc5KCGteM/i0lY5UTO9msdtrU\nJ5KtbSdS+OozhBPDoMofLLUDTS1wCXNYA+ax7KCQcAgcxrQfN/4fC/WzRFilaPEp\n8mi77DcuD4Xi/aB9GoXaRLEfN3Vw1taXZhUSZ7HhA889onapes5jmYNSqprgqXUJ\nxI6MMbiC0VgKBnZyaIu4tCAkhrRsyp5QF1/w1jeQ2P2yWH/j2vjJ9Be7CWBKZBrE\nlorikw9HIGv5aeW0Uz7a7+8CA4tDKJuy5jCzxcmpp58ZNiHvem7CVl88DS5GM17n\nirOUDmevIlc9qXiV7mJ9G9e/y5iLINh7zL8e0yaBbxeRopnYmwXS3wlMdHdMxQYH\nRVslk+tBXsLCIc8wqNcjlCupXWyupeR5pHvcdTAEvxYrhED2YMnx3ndqcshliHos\nOXOZnH5CI635B0sFeHHR6vuFw9zQO6XSBlYsrQJYd3PHbDxdkDMqrWd5gGpwhVY8\niiDwLozVqahCDgOFIQOb\n=T4dB\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-04-11T11:47:22Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","i