api.github.com/users/aknagar","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aknagar/mfe-portal/commits/03c9109012def23b1898b08647edb80b6e1ffec2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-11T05:08:37Z","email":"35679913+aknagar@users.noreply.github.com","name":"aknagar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-11T05:08:37Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Fix/dapr statestore component filename (#85)\n\n* docs: add design spec for postgres UMI auth migration\n\n* docs: add postgres UMI auth implementation plan and update spec to use ACA-native scale rules\n\n* fix: rename statestore.yaml to state.yaml and remove obsolete backend/dapr/ folder\n\nCommunityToolkit.Aspire.Hosting.Dapr probes for component templates by type name\n(''state''), not resource name (''statestore''). The misnamed file caused the toolkit to\nfall back to state.in-memory, which cannot satisfy actorStateStore=true, preventing\nthe Dapr actor runtime from starting and causing the gRPC workflow handler to get\n''Connection refused'' on port 50001.\n\n- Rename .dapr/components/statestore.yaml -> state.yaml (the fix)\n- Delete backend/dapr/components/ (obsolete manual dapr run artefacts, unused by Aspire)\n- Update all docs to reflect Aspire-managed sidecar workflow\n- Fix stale comment in AppHost/Program.cs referencing old filename\n- Add comment explaining the type-name naming rule for future maintainers","tree":{"sha":"ac04ea6433a9964e724b623c4696f3b99cf07f97","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aknagar/mfe-portal/git/trees/ac04ea6433a9964e724b623c4696f3b99cf07f97"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aknagar/mfe-portal/git/commits/03c9109012def23b1898b08647edb80b6e1ffec2","verification":{"payload":"tree ac04ea6433a9964e724b623c4696f3b99cf07f97\nparent 8e2a0c8ff78a535438dd9d8df9c36926913f57b4\nauthor aknagar <35679913+aknagar@users.noreply.github.com> 1775884117 +0530\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1775884117 +0530\n\nFix/dapr statestore component filename (#85)\n\n* docs: add design spec for postgres UMI auth migration\n\n* docs: add postgres UMI auth implementation plan and update spec to use ACA-native scale rules\n\n* fix: rename statestore.yaml to state.yaml and remove obsolete backend/dapr/ folder\n\nCommunityToolkit.Aspire.Hosting.Dapr probes for component templates by type name\n(''state''), not resource name (''statestore''). The misnamed file caused the toolkit to\nfall back to state.in-memory, which cannot satisfy actorStateStore=true, preventing\nthe Dapr actor runtime from starting and causing the gRPC workflow handler to get\n''Connection refused'' on port 50001.\n\n- Rename .dapr/components/statestore.yaml -> state.yaml (the fix)\n- Delete backend/dapr/components/ (obsolete manual dapr run artefacts, unused by Aspire)\n- Update all docs to reflect Aspire-managed sidecar workflow\n- Fix stale comment in AppHost/Program.cs referencing old filename\n- Add comment explaining the type-name naming rule for future maintainers","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJp2ddVCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAnAoQAKpoHstVGoIArDHovt2WG25J\nvTSOU+glEt+R0ZYpBr9mIgeedOAX6PAGPJrXL4nODn92o28TJ0MNASlzudm+lVnP\nrocZdIref/hTZerFZt2oEkoI9xkxkOhVjZHPJAL+gZc+bbc+SQlV9m6QYuGOKrzh\nUn2vwQceRjiTEAFCzkLXPFIAKLwCvDngPXcQ9OlIu+htHcA7Bjf6xTA9Z7xuvcNW\nXecb0nTFuuaQ/Kz4+5UHkIh6X3qIh0+YFm06r1Alwywmc2UBld+u2krCp65LwixC\nDQX53mR6Ogn99KnO09XBHC4ieYGQpnoRPy9+vNJa3cITQ0HzzMFn5eKOiH/UXB+3\n0zjJ/ewGqFTjJ4anIbEEsJnpD+KFK3Bh3saCXfZzhjW7Kx15g7TjZaUZi0q+XciY\n6uz70PH6vrcfYtW9yNgAug5skUYrde0Ajki4UO3xEJ/Zzc9t5AAlQDLqHjyV5WbN\nt5s1FztWXaino1fGfY9DDCANTxLjB7HiUllz01MwziXh26FA7oaAxT79MgkujBnl\nLxc+lqChTvsrLrzrLrnZ+MjHAaXgLfWhjdJERYAhTLXVF+OPPh/iE+RMFdFZ8S/t\n/qbFM+NsZ0YMXW1HvPo0ULrRpg/nhS/nTB+Xl72QalaUT+ziXJ48FVnJyP9W33QY\n0kS/NUefDUUG2QuVS0Ef\n=B3Ge\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-04-11T05:08:37Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864