tra ID auth\n\n* refactor(packages): remove dead Npgsql reference, fix duplicate Azure Npgsql entry, alphabetise Aspire package refs\n\n* chore(bicep): regenerate aspire-output — postgres Flexible Server with Entra ID auth, no postgres secrets\n\n- postgres/postgres.bicep: replace Docker ACA container with Azure Database for PostgreSQL Flexible Server\n  - authConfig: activeDirectoryAuth=Enabled, passwordAuth=Disabled\n  - Auto-creates productdb and weatherdb databases\n  - AllowAllAzureIps firewall rule for ACA connectivity\n- augmentservice-roles-postgres/augmentservice-roles-postgres.bicep: new role assignment module\n  - Grants UMI (augmentservice_identity) AD admin on the Flexible Server\n- augmentservice/augmentservice.bicep: secrets removed, plain env vars added\n  - Removed: postgres_password_value param and all 6 postgres secret entries\n  - Added: postgres_outputs_connectionstring and postgres_outputs_hostname params\n  - ConnectionStrings__productdb and ConnectionStrings__weatherdb now use value: (no secretRef)\n  - Added KEDA scale.rules with ACA managed-identity postgresql scaler (fixes KEDAScalerFailed)\n- main.bicep: wires postgres and augmentservice-roles-postgres modules\n  - New module postgres referencing postgres/postgres.bicep\n  - New module augmentservice_roles_postgres referencing augmentservice-roles-postgres/\n  - New outputs: postgres_connectionString, postgres_hostName, augmentservice_identity_principalName\n\n* chore: ignore compiled ARM JSON from az bicep build in aspire-output","tree":{"sha":"a51a7e0526a0c0d1c0e0885ddeb369719a76823c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aknagar/mfe-portal/git/trees/a51a7e0526a0c0d1c0e0885ddeb369719a76823c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aknagar/mfe-portal/git/commits/f531e8ebfe8e1515eede99afd67d330d686f274e","verification":{"payload":"tree a51a7e0526a0c0d1c0e0885ddeb369719a76823c\nparent 810e9cef69130682650dce16c19fb4e0db6e8d84\nauthor aknagar <35679913+aknagar@users.noreply.github.com> 1775877916