d0543811f87cbc3bb73934ed0c53ce6b807/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-10T18:29:05Z","email":"35679913+aknagar@users.noreply.github.com","name":"aknagar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-10T18:29:05Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(postgres): disable GSSAPI negotiation and switch to Azure Flexible Server (#81)\n\n- Add GssEncryptionMode=Disable to all three AddNpgsqlDbContext calls to\n  prevent Npgsql 10.x from attempting GSSAPI/Kerberos negotiation that fails\n  in ACA container environments and corrupts SCRAM-SHA-256 authentication,\n  causing 28P01 password auth failures\n\n- Replace AddPostgres (ephemeral container) with AddAzurePostgresFlexibleServer,\n  mirroring the existing Redis/ServiceBus dev-vs-Azure pattern; RunAsContainer()\n  is used in Development so local aspire run is unaffected\n\n- Add Aspire.Hosting.Azure.PostgreSQL 13.2.0 package to Directory.Packages.props\n  and MfePortal.AppHost.csproj\n\n- Remove --parameter postgres-password from infra-provision workflows; Azure\n  Flexible Server manages admin credentials internally through Aspire/Bicep","tree":{"sha":"1718e7b2dc51e3c2a78f8d2f6e9aa60e9311039c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aknagar/mfe-portal/git/trees/1718e7b2dc51e3c2a78f8d2f6e9aa60e9311039c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aknagar/mfe-portal/git/commits/73b56d0543811f87cbc3bb73934ed0c53ce6b807","verification":{"payload":"tree 1718e7b2dc51e3c2a78f8d2f6e9aa60e9311039c\nparent ec7e8a6bcde766f6eb331d90d8d468013f58dd8f\nauthor aknagar <35679913+aknagar@users.noreply.github.com> 1775845745 +0530\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1775845745 +0530\n\nfix(postgres): disable GSSAPI negotiation and switch to Azure Flexible Server (#81)\n\n- Add GssEncryptionMode=Disable to all three AddNpgsqlDbContext calls to\n  prevent Npgsql 10.x from attempting GSSAPI/Kerberos negotiation that fails\n  in ACA container environments and corrupts SCRAM-SHA-256 authentication,\n  causing 28P01 password auth failures\n\n- Replace AddPostgres (ephemeral container) with AddAzurePostgresFlexibleServer,\n  mirroring the existing Redis/ServiceBus dev-vs-Azure pattern; RunAsContainer()\n  is used in Development so local aspire run is unaffected\n\n- Add Aspire.Hosting.Azure.PostgreSQL 13.2.0 package to Directory.Packages.props\n  and MfePortal.AppHost.csproj\n\n- Remove --parameter postgres-password from infra-provision workflows; Azure\n  Flexible Server manages admin credentials internally through Aspire/Bicep","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJp2UFxCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAALnsQACqRmaaA0qaRWuMw1mXJ9INW\nGU0/DqFXMe3HFkA76AFzqOxWozRtepemghJSUdOyHx55uqJuOYDznijYlXa9Yn/k\n6RQ1FDLbkATQzCksXdwZpOaeJh8pbJ8ld6jfPv/Y9GMPk4yBXhB8ebBpJ8klxK4e\ndL7zBjrZ7m4O9al260LTPa4CfwfNT9zYf/P/mSwrRWIXyLlni8XjPqW1nwbbRnK/\nWLCSkcUdua9dg9loRQtvFgxq8CtsjVgx6Cd2GTwKKALa6PawGZS/Y2LrtIh9ErG4\n+MYjXLrfUgAQmiXgvxVzqBqOXhLWRhKjZWNd6LazUcTFeqorR0BHSzgfOYOOvx/C\nSw8/wiR9acdQwAL2bcgK9Y8ZrUar2ThNdsoyH8nxqcYi/pqHhEYgWJ2Ja4dXUODb\nrZPUcxG5+Eptau+WhvosRBxoa8aUI+U3DVH5uxcAXvSywOirEhf6e9NoHwCUCuYp\nxaaFfLXiPbQwNS0WbCr/g+kpDWDOJncfJdDK+XQAdJd5zfVICHuw9trslNMCspFw\nPZqhDf3bcDzrfc+7unnN37EdbEjOdkz9fZR8rG/nLW8cFkaR60JME9dgEUwe/nbd\nRqNYO3CP665i/40Hauqg6d2sTuQmBtnjtewbEMt0jVAmh3GLfzJkoGC1Mpk8YyTS\naOUtjcGF+6POEDNiLjOE\n=CZpw\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-04-10T18:29:06Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/aknagar/mfe-portal/commit/73b56d0543811f87cbc3bb73934ed0c53ce6b807","node_id":"C_kwDOQv8lUNoAKDczYjU2ZDA1NDM4MTFmODdjYmMzYmI3MzkzNGVkMGM1M2NlNmI4MDc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/aknagar/mfe-portal/commit/ec7e8a6bcde766f6eb331d90d8d468013f58dd8f","sha":"ec7e8a6bcde766f6eb331d90d8d468013f58dd8f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aknagar/mfe-portal/commits/ec7e8a6bcde766f6eb331d90d8d468013f58dd8f"}],"sha":"73b56d0543811f87cbc3bb73934ed0c53ce6b807","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aknagar/mfe-portal/commits/73b56d0543811f87cbc3bb73934ed0c53ce6b807"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35679913?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aknagar/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aknagar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aknagar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aknagar/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/aknagar","id":35679913,"login":"aknagar","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1Njc5OTEz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aknagar/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aknagar/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aknagar/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aknagar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aknagar/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/aknagar","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aknagar/mfe-portal/commits/ec7e8a6bcde766f6eb331d90d8d468013f58dd8f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-10T17:01:20Z","email":"35679913+aknagar@users.noreply.github.com","name":"aknagar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-10T17:01:20Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(dapr): register Dapr sidecar and components in ACA Bicep output (#79)\n\nThe CommunityToolkit.Aspire.Hosting.Dapr package does not generate\nDapr-related Bicep when publishing to Azure Container Apps. This caused\nDapr to be completely absent from the ACA environment on every deploy.\n\nThree gaps are fixed:\n\n1. PublishAsAzureContainerApp on augmentservice injects the missing\n   configuration.dapr block (enabled, appId, appProtocol, appPort=8080)\n   into the container app Bicep so ACA actually injects the Dapr sidecar.\n\n2. ConfigureInfrastructure on the ACA managed environment adds\n   Microsoft.App/managedEnvironments/daprComponents child resources for\n   both pubsub and statestore, using Entra ID auth (useEntraID=true) and\n   scoped to augmentservice only. The Redis Enterprise hostname is threaded\n   as a Bicep parameter via AsProvisioningParameter so main.bicep wires\n   the daprRedis module output correctly.\n\n3. Added the missing .dapr/components/statestore.yaml for local dev parity,\n   mirroring pubsub.yaml with secretKeyRef for host/password and\n   actorStateStore=true for the Dapr Workflow engine.","tree":{"sha":"a63c02ae35e07d296d1ffb454b59a5d3538a6c52","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aknagar/mfe-portal/git/trees/a63c02ae35e07d296d1ffb454b59a5d3538a6c52"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aknagar/mfe-portal/git/commits/ec7e8a6bcde766f6eb331d90d8d468013f58dd8f","verification":{"payload":"tree a63c02ae35e07d296d1ffb454b59a5d3538a6c52\nparent edd5b229d1dc9b62602654cde2b162982d149a18\nauthor aknagar <35679913+aknagar@users.noreply.github.com> 1775840480 +0530\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1775840480 +0530\n\nfix(dapr): register Dapr sidecar and components in ACA Bicep output (#79)\n\nThe CommunityToolkit.Aspire.Hosting.Dapr package does not generate\nDapr-related Bicep when publishing to Azure Container Apps. This caused\nDapr to be completely absent from the ACA environment on every deploy.\n\nThree gaps are fixed:\n\n1. PublishAsAzureContainerApp on augmentservice injects the missing\n   configuration.dapr block (enabled, appId, appProtocol, appPort=8080)\n   into the container app Bicep so ACA actually injects the Dapr sidecar.\n\n2. ConfigureInfrastructure on the ACA managed environment adds\n   Microsoft.App/managedEnvironments/daprComponents child resources for\n   both pubsub and statestore, using Entra ID auth (useEntraID=true) and\n   scoped to augmentservice only. The Redis Enterprise hostname is threaded\n   as a Bicep parameter via AsProvisioningParameter so main.bicep wires\n   the daprRedis module output correctly.\n\n3. Added the missing .dapr/components/statestore.yaml for local dev parity,\n   mirroring pubsub.yaml with secretKeyRef for host/password and\n   actorStateStore=true for the Dapr Workflow engine.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJp2SzgCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAz/cQAKoaXF/dWNeCcUsETSs26bpJ\nHV/oMFkVC7sqpk0GP5+s7gTUhFwxDo2T+VgUkyUh3BjlIGcc4/5w2iu5fBwdZIPD\nOTZpcRXWwjoamusptHeUNGyQ5iepE2lwd62Y0xN7u3jXuVhjAR9yjL3rvPvIXOCq\nYEm4fiusyBbJ9dWCNd3vyqBrmvCX2ketKco4ifAwPKOlcpN8J0mY3OVz/eMbEiY+\n1bnS5oXeEjJWM5eL165nc+GKmI9BDWA4zkn8ZmuRRtBX33MpEtXSjHBCMzoh47Pa\n0V14LjBogRJmep4gdwAECOYH+wHlnLwN91+qQa/jMeP7PIj2KT002UJ+8Kw0nKg+\nTosv27rzoh85GzJ7O2/xxG7GpbSXAuzbeimVZ8yJjfymk36G+Q4cMrwxfV1DS9iW\nm68XKL0ipgAF56kIMFm95Ky4rfjpiNvlTWRg9A2+k6s7U1Ef7DZItCYcJZ5k9m6J\nldwu72YTy3DqACsYlUW7EBUCqD7asEgYo3Oqenf/FCdvB6uEwiUBT2zSf4xu+ZoI\nLhSutBEqVNfnSY69kqFsfKMu1ZrM/USrAoGbGIN8FlrJJqtdWgvTaYsDcaDBf0nr\nfvf6xiuX5/aB6Hd/tzGDYdu23hfzEibuOLO1DiQje2GiO3uWE0w0vrun3pd4vCkF\nzLoY/ektS1hm9cnFOYgW\n=U20U\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-04-10T17:01:21Z"}},"committer":{"