al development\n- Wraps UseAzureMonitor() in a APPLICATIONINSIGHTS_CONNECTION_STRING guard to prevent\n  InvalidOperationException crash on startup when the connection string is absent (local dev)\n- Removes now-unused IHostApplicationBuilder overloads and helper methods (no call sites)\n- Removes unused Microsoft.AspNetCore.Routing and Microsoft.Extensions.Configuration imports","tree":{"sha":"8783b2c46937c60d6ed6ef10a80f6cbe552256d4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aknagar/mfe-portal/git/trees/8783b2c46937c60d6ed6ef10a80f6cbe552256d4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aknagar/mfe-portal/git/commits/5b89b291d0177861c1812f383d89a825624cf482","verification":{"payload":"tree 8783b2c46937c60d6ed6ef10a80f6cbe552256d4\nparent 232dc8929b11ecca60c5c3ed0e09d63e06777f0b\nauthor aknagar <35679913+aknagar@users.noreply.github.com> 1775666986 +0530\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1775666986 +0530\n\nfix(telemetry): restore OTel setup and guard UseAzureMonitor behind connection string check (#77)\n\n- Restores OTel logging (AddOpenTelemetry on builder.Logging), metrics, tracing,\n  and OTLP exporter so the Aspire dashboard receives telemetry in local development\n- Wraps UseAzureMonitor() in a APPLICATIONINSIGHTS_CONNECTION_STRING guard to prevent\n  InvalidOperationException crash on startup when the connection string is absent (local dev)\n- Removes now-unused IHostApplicationBuilder overloads and helper methods (no call sites)\n- Removes unused Microsoft.AspNetCore.Routing and Microsoft.Extensions.Configuration imports","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJp1ocqCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAARGYQABWxPagMCxqhdwuWvbQNzAmQ\nknhB+Jc/3AtbPdj8Cf0m/+0EwqLAB7PLitY/hgZSD54uEXHwMGxcGrpw04ALpnOZ\nvszvgXIOlZpGxpxYFBq6rYIgypxEekTHLna5Pkg5V9tuH+pXQBHUz0Jef4DIWrqJ\n0CV1+TWSZyXXvK4hoysKYig5hm66sVLWMsJdMLrDqalFRt0smngJF1yDVKi2+cGS\nTLONPE2scCBZ+91Ew3eV0oPVuTRUhyiY7PDN7tFtgZ8OixmlihXHXkK0EYJQ3zSf\nl5QJq/5ljq3nqjvKDZymM0qGhhgf7UTACoYw1ElxZfC+jkFEn7nsTFtD7