.com/users/aknagar/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aknagar/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aknagar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aknagar/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/aknagar","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aknagar/mfe-portal/commits/84e15782fa78dfd501a536244fec2183ac1f68e6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-30T15:20:47Z","email":"35679913+aknagar@users.noreply.github.com","name":"aknagar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-30T15:20:47Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix: add --non-interactive and Azure__ env vars to CD deploy steps (#67)\n\n- Add --non-interactive flag to prod aspire deploy command (was missing, only env var guard existed)\n- Add Azure__SubscriptionId/ResourceGroup/Location env block to both prod and test deploy steps\n- Ensures process-parameters step never blocks on stdin in CI for either environment","tree":{"sha":"ebfee9c7301d5054b4fe1295fde730beffb4062f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aknagar/mfe-portal/git/trees/ebfee9c7301d5054b4fe1295fde730beffb4062f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aknagar/mfe-portal/git/commits/84e15782fa78dfd501a536244fec2183ac1f68e6","verification":{"payload":"tree ebfee9c7301d5054b4fe1295fde730beffb4062f\nparent 9dc9dcb752b2bf2c9808f9e2c48bc42b4a615701\nauthor aknagar <35679913+aknagar@users.noreply.github.com> 1774884047 +0530\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1774884047 +0530\n\nfix: add --non-interactive and Azure__ env vars to CD deploy steps (#67)\n\n- Add --non-interactive flag to prod aspire deploy command (was missing, only env var guard existed)\n- Add Azure__SubscriptionId/ResourceGroup/Location env block to both prod and test deploy steps\n- Ensures process-parameters step never blocks on stdin in CI for either environment","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEG