b.com/users/aknagar/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/aknagar","id":35679913,"login":"aknagar","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1Njc5OTEz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aknagar/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aknagar/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aknagar/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aknagar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aknagar/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/aknagar","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aknagar/mfe-portal/commits/dedd27daf8fb96a4639c9097952392513f493c19/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-22T15:09:23Z","email":"35679913+aknagar@users.noreply.github.com","name":"aknagar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-22T15:09:23Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix: eliminate all skipped tests using Moq, SQLite, and persistent-connection factories (#56)\n\n- Fix 7 LoggingBehaviorTests skipped due to NSubstitute ILogger limitation: replace with Moq Mock<ILogger<T>> and Verify on the underlying ILogger.Log call\n- Fix 3 ProxyApplicationServiceTests skipped for same reason\n- Fix 1 DeleteForecastCommandHandlerTests skipped: use Moq ThrowsAsync; expand try/catch in handler to cover GetForecastAsync\n- Fix 4 UserRoleRepositoryTests skipped: rewrite GetUserPermissionsAsync to load roles then SelectMany+Distinct in-memory (SQLite-compatible); tests use real SQLite context\n- Fix Program.cs JWT auth to accept Test environment\n- Add IntegrationTestHelpers.cs with shared RemoveDbContextDescriptors / ReplaceDaprServices / InitDb<T> helpers\n- Rewrite WeatherEndpointTests with persistent SqliteConnection factory; fix route from /weatherforecast to /weather/{date}; seed Forecast in factory\n- Rewrite RateLimitingIntegrationTests: each test creates its own factory (no IClassFixture) so rate-limit window is fresh per test; fix rate-limiter config to read PermitLimit lazily via IOptionsMonitor<RateLimitingOptions>","tree":{"sha":"c173f42f2c296edf5218ecde0836ceef7b7a17f5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aknagar/mfe-portal/git/trees/c173f42f2c296edf5218ecde0836ceef7b7a17f5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aknagar/mfe-portal/git/commits/dedd27daf8fb96a4639c9097952392513f493c19","verification":{"payload":"tree c173f42f2c296edf5218ecde0836ceef7b7a17f5\nparent 2724102215995abc3445fa7ea98afd517d5ef60b\nauthor aknagar <35679913+aknagar@users.noreply.github.com> 1774192163 +0530\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1774192163 +0530\n\nfix: eliminate all skipped tests using Moq, SQLite, and persistent-connection factories (#56)\n\n- Fix 7 LoggingBehaviorTests skipped due to NSubstitute ILogger limitation: replace with Moq Mock<ILogger<T>> and Verify on the underlying ILogger.Log call\n- Fix 3 ProxyApplicationServiceTests skipped for same reason\n- Fix 1 DeleteForecastCommandHandlerTests skipped: use Moq ThrowsAsync; expand try/catch in handler to cover GetForecastAsync\n- Fix 4 UserRoleRepositoryTests skipped: rewrite GetUserPermissionsAsync to load roles then SelectMany+Distinct in-memory (SQLite-compatible); tests use real SQLite context\n- Fix Program.cs JWT auth to accept Test environment\n- Add IntegrationTestHelpers.cs with shared RemoveDbContextDescriptors / ReplaceDaprServices / InitDb<T> helpers\n- Rewrite WeatherEndpointTests with persistent SqliteConnection factory; fix route from /weatherforecast to /weather/{date}; seed Forecast in factory\n- Rewrite RateLimitingIntegrationTests: each test creates its own factory (no IClassFixture) so rate-limit window is fresh per test; fix rate-limiter config to read PermitLimit lazily via IOptionsMonitor<RateLimitingOptions>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJpwAYjCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAA1YQAIT6xv+WptaM1jku4SfWkxKx\nVx833pjfdpnimwRrXGe6B80/kUNrm8TW7QG7+qcbWdZ