ing\n--results-directory ./TestResults on their dotnet test commands. Without\nthis flag, dotnet test writes .trx files into each project''s TestResults/\nsubdirectory rather than the central backend/TestResults/ path that the\nupload-artifact step globs. Combined with if-no-files-found: ignore, the\nartifact was silently skipped, causing the downstream publish-test-results\njob to fail with ''Artifact not found for name: unit-test-results''.","tree":{"sha":"7d067279bccfaf3fdfccdd2bbdd0364e2e3b99c4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aknagar/mfe-portal/git/trees/7d067279bccfaf3fdfccdd2bbdd0364e2e3b99c4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aknagar/mfe-portal/git/commits/4c370ed60a8f31dec4fbd317e804ab1f41e3965f","verification":{"payload":"tree 7d067279bccfaf3fdfccdd2bbdd0364e2e3b99c4\nparent 93dc8122f35589ebccb518697b450fd6fb31b7f0\nauthor aknagar <35679913+aknagar@users.noreply.github.com> 1774164021 +0530\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1774164021 +0530\n\nFix/ci artifact not found (#46)\n\n* feat(opencode): add /run-ci-backend slash command\n\nAdds a local CI pipeline slash command that builds the backend solution,\nruns unit tests with code coverage (excluding Integration/E2E/LoadTest),\ngenerates a ReportGenerator report, and displays a formatted tabular\nsummary of build status, test results, and per-assembly coverage.\n\n* docs: document git worktree workflow in docs/GIT.md\n\n* docs: trim GIT.md to branching strategy only\n\n* docs: replace branching strategy with worktree branching workflow\n\n* chore: lower coverage threshold from 80% to 75%\n\n* fix: add --results-directory and if-no-files-found: warn to test jobs\n\nThe unit-tests, integration-tests, and e2e-tests jobs were missing\n--results-directory ./TestResults on their dotnet test commands. Without\nthis flag, dotnet test writes .trx files into each project''s TestResults/\nsubdirectory rather than the central backend/TestResults/ path that the\nupload-artifact step globs. Combined with if-no-files-found: ignore, the\nartifact was silently skipped, causing the downstream publish-test-results\njob to fail with ''Artifact not found for name: unit-test-results''.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJpv5g1CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAiRsQAI35f/b1gEOYun2JEjhWefmu\n3/DIwyh8+gIsZECW2vyiS9UcUB9u4Shh0H/11y7p7mQoSkdmxzuq+64WSoXEYQeq\n6HWjbqez/AseSQY1B7h4yqzyIIqsIbotfiwzLnDz5v03i1O2sJQxz7F+oq3fnJYn\nGtOUL86xfHvq30xlD+R2oVdVs1BhubmmIP+Wb/HbXjVuW3NBDI0NmNP6LMU755/y\nbNgxX+PMi0tUISRfvzPDsQJeFKthGSk+GUhVCTtCRikBDhM0DBFDzmhP6k0Prp7C\n4Ps3jrxdYOtc0Ao3Dq8KihESnOC4FppVmty3kVSlKNO36YnYwiKNiwBtFhiMHMI3\n1jfJVYalWvVzJvnBjqrBPAHw6DqhcqLl2TJcUsLfDDs1ROILuLFlx4C49IEc+ZMb\n7KhOZMNWeZ6mwtaQq/Yn361Aw77rpLEVYdW1ZMbMJBFjcJnSjCw++Kx1154g5D4p\nOs1mbHkMvAciSCkEBDMygN14N5IWsF3qKFJoZbNHLvxIbmKJfGOOWomsNUUbPU0I\nXGYEMnYyIgB12pMxSYFPOmFfczyXVgJkP2rfH8IQtdmBEilw4tZpLPLbqU0DyNsA\nevsQm/uPamhXsUIb4m/6ls42B/SWtgET4DURN73LxsSgBCq3RlFAAcbhUWoThGZZ\nFJuN35N13W49S725Yabf\n=bRt2\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-03-22T07:20:23Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","us