"},"message":"Feature/aspire deploy logging (#41)\n\n* docs: move backend docs to backend/docs directory\n\n* fix: add debug logging and raise timeouts on aspire deploy step\n\n- Add --log-level debug and --include-exception-details flags to surface\n  full pipeline logs in CI output, making timeout root cause diagnosable\n- Raise step timeout from 30m to 90m and job timeout from 45m to 100m\n  to match observed run durations (runs #26-#28 took 1h 24m to 2h 18m)\n\n* docs: consolidate agent instructions and remove duplicate files\n\n- Rewrite copilot-instructions.md with architecture, build/test commands, conventions, and doc index\n\n- Simplify AGENTS.md and CLAUDE.md to reference copilot-instructions.md (avoid duplication)\n\n- Improve frontend-aspire.instructions.md with actionable dev/test/debug steps\n\n- Remove obsolete Local-Setup.md and azd-cli-commands.md\n\n* chore: remove opencode pipelines\n\n* chore: remove outdated copilot instructions file","tree":{"sha":"93663216c76c647ada40fcdae00b40797b59bbdd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aknagar/mfe-portal/git/trees/93663216c76c647ada40fcdae00b40797b59bbdd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aknagar/mfe-portal/git/commits/8eafa70104d97d5bec9f1ee8e7e9c83b9eff7849","verification":{"payload":"tree 93663216c76c647ada40fcdae00b40797b59bbdd\nparent 63139d00f60777581b7937791f164116ebd5442a\nauthor aknagar <35679913+aknagar@users.noreply.github.com> 1774154370 +0530\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1774154370 +0530\n\nFeature/aspire deploy logging (#41)\n\n* docs: move backend docs to backend/docs directory\n\n* fix: add debug logging and raise timeouts on aspire deploy step\n\n- Add --log-level debug and --include-exception-details flags to surface\n  full pipeline logs in CI output, making timeout root cause diagnosable\n- Raise step timeout from 30m to 90m and job timeout from 45m to 100m\n  to match observed run durations (runs #26-#28 took 1h 24m to 2h 18m)\n\n* docs: consolidate agent instructions and remove duplicate files\n\n- Rewrite copilot-instructions.md with architecture, build/test commands, conventions, and doc index\n\n- Simplify AGENTS.md and CLAUDE.md to reference copilot-instructions.md (avoid duplication)\n\n- Improve frontend-aspire.instructions.md with actionable dev/test/debug steps\n\n- Remove obsolete Local-Setup.md and azd-cli-commands.md\n\n* chore: remove opencode pipelines\n\n* chore: remove outdated copilot instructions file","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJpv3KCCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAyboQAFWenShRnK9f9iT/ZHbX2lWr\nXxw70cgD18JuPqdyP9x/3GgWc2y7EQTTy4tRaH50WB70kLnLpXguHBoxcf/Gr/N8\njmbTSrJumlv0SpcTORGqUi01EnNmPozEwJE2r1fLr+j3ZE6wmYKX1lDaDG6yEDQR\ngJy1SFH3LLSckw/YFi+vNLRT0pH+DzDCmy1ALqytZN7FKbqKnKMMQB9+X9U44w1W\n7LIrssM5AIwMbwCD29vtc+LsdhRL53rxyGepgThfP0T2Zc14CH4LipEF1FHqZ2D6\nLmX5oTkv5s+78bT1O6cQXFE28ctFUFdLxq9J/D0zaS562EomoZQZiUGIHULfWemL\nHbuQcvie3q4j65DU5Qm0riDvY0q1T8hk+vMT9sh0yke6xNpHybZYM3J4/8clCvfS\nqUxmQrkRdAxJnOMcS/BT8sjJQIDKoSfzfD7KGOTlmUuI9UT1oUo+ysEgqhWFZV81\n1GtOzCQRGOd+YtRU4vmIrX2HzuYOls1BzoFeCQWPMFQ79ch6cKBOit/bBd8klUUM\njJ9nVRiCrSEAPjxv2w810aoEJbQF6dpVxGeusz90JkXlW/lX/tM8sCbJtgf+TYUC\ngI+cOk5POt046/O765jYN00xbJO0PZeAc33Im2rC4LXVoGOYkDUJ5vk0ZuKZcdS9\nplh8dw4WJGPtZeIn7wNz\n=OAkr\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-03-22T04:39:31Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_