r that strips CR and LF characters\nand applies it to all log statements that include the permission value\n(lines 103 and 109-110 of HasPermissionAsync).","tree":{"sha":"f55e31719ac64a338a3beedd0836b4c8b27b8865","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aknagar/mfe-portal/git/trees/f55e31719ac64a338a3beedd0836b4c8b27b8865"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aknagar/mfe-portal/git/commits/50b39598650e9c9ab7c82b37ef66ac68a8a48e70","verification":{"payload":"tree f55e31719ac64a338a3beedd0836b4c8b27b8865\nparent 357b2bb67b1ce51806b9d9099855e3f93064f4a1\nauthor aknagar <35679913+aknagar@users.noreply.github.com> 1774121372 +0530\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1774121372 +0530\n\nFix/codeql log injection (#33)\n\n* docs: add repository health report with top 10 metrics and scorecard\n\n* fix: sanitize user input before logging to prevent log injection (CWE-117)\n\nCodeQL reported that the ''permission'' parameter—a user-supplied string—was\nlogged directly without sanitization, allowing an attacker to inject\nnewline characters to forge or split log entries.\n\nAdds a private SanitizeForLog helper that strips CR and LF characters\nand applies it to all log statements that include the permission value\n(lines 103 and 109-110 of HasPermissionAsync).","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJpvvGcCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAmi4QAIhOT4C1m+xw1fZimNojvY+R\nXUP4gv4HtKNyV8I+DnzruNFhEnI0mBFYstf5PkIl43idRCDPpX1QAK1GNEgCKgCn\nlWeQZf2GNy/2Ihy7UbAFJfW+Wtk1XYGCrhpR3O2zKpIAEqjgi/X5W70SqKaMgQWI\ncNuNHokDLcQQkbornhoybsZAfBCfs218ypQqGCLH+skLePhjSIdW+EdrcmNR9xWa\nJwBY86n/N1c+n+mhBccPHb7JQqxTrw2+OYAsNat1WXJoIN/IAPcklmtVQpng8u8R\nj0x2hbKHN01WqCBozl51BoAsx4SVjZWsV3eEXaglfcHKOpZoRLPdpZ32/lxoBxbP\nGg+YysZz1y8bx1MpOanAPjQ4Eej0HdnEWzf5uxfo1SNsQPqJOtgLvsKwLiN7sVt9\nYbD9JbQJIkbBPgeSfG3n3Oc+l684NL1XKIyImzOTfqNZa9Wg1wSpSYkhbs2yFOTU\nl5FjWgWDWX3VbWV9i4CywIYzzKrmC84puCHpyOZxUqJvJqzp0Sg2I/5R6R/5TN0P\nEmzD+oV5Zqpu6iZut7jGcvyeXdbvGaFSiHTUS2+6HrSfoTw7G7KkmSbtx5pm60O3\nBroEn5UOw