22Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Fix/dapr moq mocking (#30)\n\n* chore: add Moq package to Api unit test project\n\n* fix: use Moq to mock DaprWorkflowClient via IDaprWorkflowClient in ApprovalsControllerTests\n\n- Change ApprovalsController constructor to accept IDaprWorkflowClient (Dapr built-in interface)\n  instead of sealed DaprWorkflowClient, enabling unit testing with Moq\n- Register IDaprWorkflowClient in Program.cs DI container (maps to DaprWorkflowClient)\n- Rewrite ApprovalsControllerTests with Mock<IDaprWorkflowClient> and Mock<DaprClient>\n  (DaprClient is abstract and mockable directly — no wrapper interface needed)\n- Remove IDaprStateClient.cs that was incorrectly added by previous agent\n- All 17 tests now pass without Skip attributes","tree":{"sha":"12fe0512b3f19f68e0700092f1cec273b880404a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aknagar/mfe-portal/git/trees/12fe0512b3f19f68e0700092f1cec273b880404a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aknagar/mfe-portal/git/commits/5bb360ae7f377e046c15828e2ff31ca2d8af07a3","verification":{"payload":"tree 12fe0512b3f19f68e0700092f1cec273b880404a\nparent 9e58914398c7617762d948261d1128803d7caafb\nauthor aknagar <35679913+aknagar@users.noreply.github.com> 1774119502 +0530\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1774119502 +0530\n\nFix/dapr moq mocking (#30)\n\n* chore: add Moq package to Api unit test project\n\n* fix: use Moq to mock DaprWorkflowClient via IDaprWorkflowClient in ApprovalsControllerTests\n\n- Change ApprovalsController constructor to accept IDaprWorkflowClient (Dapr built-in interface)\n  instead of sealed DaprWorkflowClient, enabling unit testing with Moq\n- Register IDaprWorkflowClient in Program.cs DI container (maps to DaprWorkflowClient)\n- Rewrite ApprovalsControllerTests with Mock<IDaprWorkflowClient> and Mock<DaprClient>\n  (DaprClient is abstract and mockable directly — no wrapper interface needed)\n- Remove IDaprStateClient.cs that was incorrectly added by previous ag