4:05Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"additional tests (#24)\n\n* feat: update environment configuration and remove unnecessary port mappings in docker-compose\n\n* added testcases\n\n* feat: update post-create and post-start scripts, modify launch settings, and configure Redis host in pubsub and statestore components\n\n* fix: unskip 9 tests and add coverage reporting script\n\n- Fix GlobalExceptionHandlerTests (7 tests): add PropertyNameCaseInsensitive to JsonSerializer\n  options so camelCase response fields deserialize correctly\n- Fix ProductEndpointsTests (2 tests): call ChangeTracker.Clear() to bypass EF cache\n  after ExecuteUpdateAsync/ExecuteDeleteAsync so FindAsync queries the DB\n- Add backend/tests/parse-coverage.ps1 to parse Cobertura XML and produce\n  per-file coverage table merging Api + Core test results\n\n* fix: exclude LoadTest category from unit-tests and coverage CI jobs\n\nK6 load tests (Category=LoadTest) require Aspire DCP tooling which is\nnot available on the standard CI runner, causing 3 test failures in\nboth the unit-tests and coverage jobs. Exclude them from those runs;\nthey have their own dedicated workflow (k6-load-tests.yml).\n\n* Fix PR #24 code review comments\n\n- ReserveInventoryActivity: use discard _ instead of unused etag variable\n- OrdersController: remove unused _serviceBusSender and _daprClient fields/params\n- OrdersControllerTests: update constructor call to match new 2-param signature\n- Order.cs: add [RegularExpression(@\"\\S+\")] to reject whitespace-only Name values\n- OrderProcessingWorkflowTests: fix NSubstitute overload mismatches\n  - DidNotReceive: use non-generic CallActivityAsync (matches workflow call)\n  - CreateTimer: stub TimeSpan overload (workflow calls CreateTimer(ApprovalTimeout))\n  - WaitForExternalEventAsync: stub 1-arg overload (no CancellationToken in workflow)","tree":{"sha":"b38ab203349cc732a7bb49d7727e215cda357e77","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aknagar/mfe-portal/git/trees/b38ab203349cc732a7bb49d7727e215cda357e77"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aknagar/mfe-portal/git/commits/24ca3b44e661bc4fc2028e10e776a7d3d1833533","verification":{"payload":"tree b38ab203349cc732a7bb49d7727e215cda357e77\nparent 1dbe24e073669f11ccc5044d5636c06365d42a69\nauthor aknagar <35679913+aknagar@users.noreply.github.com> 1774103045 +0530\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1774103045 +0530\n\nadditional tests (#24)\n\n* feat: update environment configuration and remove unnecessary port mappings in docker-compose\n\n* added testcases\n\n* feat: update post-create and post-start scripts, modify launch settings, and configure Redis host in pubsub and statestore components\n\n* fix: unskip 9 tests and add coverage reporting script\n\n- Fix GlobalExceptionHandlerTests (7 tests): add PropertyNameCaseInsensitive to JsonSerializer\n  options so camelCase response fields deserialize correctly\n- Fix ProductEndpointsTests (2 tests): call ChangeTracker.Clear() to bypass EF cache\n  after ExecuteUpdateAsync/ExecuteDeleteAsync so FindAsync queries the DB\n- Add backend/tests/parse-coverage.ps1 to parse Cobertura XML and produce\n  per-file coverage table merging Api + Core test results\n\n* fix: exclude LoadTest category from unit-tests and coverage CI jobs\n\nK6 load tests (Category=LoadTest) require Aspire DCP tooling which is\nnot available on the standard CI runner, causing 3 test failures in\nboth the unit-tests and coverage jobs. Exclude them from those runs;\nthey have their own dedicated workflow (k6-load-tests.yml).\n\n* Fix PR #24 code review comments\n\n- ReserveInventoryActivity: use discard _ instead of unused etag variable\n- OrdersController: remove unused _serviceBusSender and _daprClient fields/params\n- OrdersControllerTests: update constructor call to match new 2-param signature\n- Order.cs: add [RegularExpression(@\"\\S+\")] to reject whitespace-only Name values\n- OrderProcessingWorkflowTests: fix NSubstitute overload mismatches\n  - DidNotReceive: use non-generic CallActivityAsync (matches workflow call)\n  - CreateTimer: stub TimeSpan overload (workflow calls CreateTimer(ApprovalTimeout))\n  - WaitForExternalEventAsync: stub 1-arg overload (no CancellationToken in workflow)","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJpvqoFCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAMAgQAIMpRO1FmpitfmlgZN7kMenN\nLi8hcLl5+HFele0DqepTz7l+vfqxdRnm0EqVY6apBrnLmeZO3l1tYI6zlWbJPoT4\najW0iiLIH6piCvtLkmxcQ9LuLN3e07pTEZ0i/sW7xUT6w32wwH7lkpEO7zyRpt0z\neB8gRzSrL2AHwSNrYirAnzy1YWPvshamst2YycKx7GxJq5QRM3sEPF0qv4hv8RET\nnsfgOFmkBWu8cGuOiPUmwJwL9LMNa/Fx77Aj/iyPCTDZMTzSH9tIqK1w3EW3dk5v\neavmyZhUKUq4bxSV8zVpfMc1vQrgdXdWRDK8MmjSEC6GTNoPD1Y/3cQS5mnkBzlg\nRy18+nhrVVl5MOGt75pJnLVBxAz9keU2sjZvP9R9vaQdcQnXx7gfd1FqHJ0ct6br\nx6WmwEsb5Ox9PqsZFG3pkSax2NMTYDWKK1btQzzFM4ZuayxiPMlcMrBDnwchdRC/\nhDjeJSO7cAvXRSJd4aiGuLEmlQgIvr7fa+NBakIgl4ma6LugGhCIskteOg2t8OMT\nnY68+zHsNQ6t9P137fPTsihwNWa6BUUlD6vbWMVL7kgWpQGTkqmtAMz/azcW2GOM\nhLAtj3ImS30GDVX7GUSABGvqNXwA5xIRyDlnvghnUDGsOQ64h5EBmVbhjW4LaJCD\n31Eqf2F+jlZ+sPYJiBXG\n=OY4h\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-03-21T14:24:06Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/