}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aknagar/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/aknagar","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aknagar/mfe-portal/commits/bb2efdb906b9e779487288969f3ee04a2bf979ea/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-08T08:16:17Z","email":"35679913+aknagar@users.noreply.github.com","name":"aknagar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-08T08:16:17Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"002 try openspec (#23)\n\n* chore: add @fission-ai/openspec as devDependency and initialize for opencode\n\n* fix: address reviewer findings on 002-try-openspec\n\nCritical fixes:\n- Fix package.json name mismatch: mfe-portal -> mfe-portal-workspace (aligns with existing lockfile)\n- Document missing openspec-sync-specs skill in archive command/skill; provide manual fallback\n\nMinor fixes:\n- Replace bare ''openspec'' CLI calls with ''npx openspec'' across all commands and skills\n- Pin @fission-ai/openspec to exact version 1.2.0 (remove ^ range) for trial reproducibility\n- Add agent-requirement warning blocks to all opsx-* commands (plan agent denies bash)\n- Amend constitution to v1.1.0 noting the OpenSpec trial and its scope/constraints\n\n* feat: opt out of openspec telemetry\n\nPrefix all npx openspec invocations in commands and skills with\nOPENSPEC_TELEMETRY=0 to unconditionally disable PostHog analytics.\n\nAlso adds a scripts.openspec wrapper and config.openspec note in\npackage.json to document the opt-out for developers invoking the CLI\noutside of the OpenCode commands.\n\n* feat: update Redis configuration for Dapr components and remove obsolete state store\n\n* feat: refactor Redis state store configuration for Dapr workflow\n\n* feat: add Dapr pubsub and state store configuration with YAML files","tree":{"sha":"395d5dce094cb7fc5a35a2de942a27867038592b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aknagar/mfe-portal/git/trees/395d5dce094cb7fc5a35a2de942a27867038592b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aknagar/mfe-portal/git/commits/bb2efdb906b9e779487288969f3ee04a2bf979ea","verification":{"payload":"tree 395d5dce094cb7fc5a35a2de942a27867038592b\nparent 779b9bb50ac8682775c23a1f596e903324cc4ce7\nauthor aknagar <35679913+aknagar@users.noreply.github.com> 1772957777 +0530\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1772957777 +0530\n\n002 try openspec (#23)\n\n* chore: add @fission-ai/openspec as devDependency and initialize for opencode\n\n* fix: address reviewer findings on 002-try-openspec\n\nCritical fixes:\n- Fix package.json name mismatch: mfe-portal -> mfe-portal-workspace (aligns with existing lockfile)\n- Document missing openspec-sync-specs skill in archive command/skill; provide manual fallback\n\nMinor fixes:\n- Replace bare ''openspec'' CLI calls with ''npx openspec'' across all commands and skills\n- Pin @fission-ai/openspec to exact version 1.2.0 (remove ^ range) for trial reproducibility\n- Add agent-requirement warning blocks to all opsx-* commands (plan agent denies bash)\n- Amend constitution to v1.1.0 noting the OpenSpec trial and its scope/constraints\n\n* feat: opt out of openspec telemetry\n\nPrefix all npx openspec invocations in commands and skills with\nOPENSPEC_TELEMETRY=0 to unconditionally disable PostHog analytics.\n\nAlso adds a scripts.openspec wrapper and config.openspec note in\npackage.json to document the opt-out for developers invoking the CLI\noutside of the OpenCode commands.\n\n* feat: update Redis configuration for Dapr components and remove obsolete state store\n\n* feat: refactor Redis state store configuration for Dapr workflow\n\n* feat: add Dapr pubsub and state store configuration with YAML files","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJprTBRCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAbfgQAKqiQdAY6wUtLZ5RU6zJK9FM\n8wXD6J0Jvp+F5o4vrYswIDMyQ2FYownCKvyAqW86evzCsqIiqo4upqe6mrrDoWbj\nvmIEOA2iRjhH248KjjWuzQuiaLCezUSCajJCfl3hLPrDWGyBCnhl6QK8LJjq4zZT\nIJBRL5yWx7VWJO