/wms2537/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wms2537/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wms2537","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Quantum3-Labs/ARBuilder/commits/e0a9ef7bc8cfc9bbaca56c605358f8e7e3a5d3d8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-07T18:07:33Z","email":"weimengsoh0827@gmail.com","name":"wms2537"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-07T18:07:33Z","email":"weimengsoh0827@gmail.com","name":"wms2537"},"message":"feat: add Nitro node troubleshooting knowledge + ingest missing node docs\n\n1. New node_troubleshooting knowledge entry in ask_orbit (TS + Python):\n   - Startup issues (missing config, no-sequencer-coordinator, permissions,\n     parent chain connectivity, deployed-at block, DAS image)\n   - Config issues (chainConfig format, 0x prefix, parentChainIsArbitrum,\n     stakeToken, missing coreContracts fields)\n   - Docker tips (pinned image, health check, logs, port mapping)\n   - Networking (Docker-to-Docker, RPC rate limits, WebSocket)\n\n2. Keyword matching triggers on error/fail/troubleshoot/crash/permission\n   and node+issue/problem/fix combinations\n\n3. Added 4 new docs to sources.json for ingestion:\n   - run-arbitrum-node/run-full-node\n   - run-arbitrum-node/nitro/build-nitro-locally\n   - customize-deployment-configuration\n   - orbit-sdk-configuring-orbit-chain-parameters","tree":{"sha":"68504ec8478edfea1249f571c2e58ec10a4f6b72","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Quantum3-Labs/ARBuilder/git/trees/68504ec8478edfea1249f571c2e58ec10a4f6b72"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Quantum3-Labs/ARBuilder/git/commits/e0a9ef7bc8cfc9bbaca56c605358f8e7e3a5d3d8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/51080539?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wms2537/events{/privacy}","followers_url