eived_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wms2537/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wms2537/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wms2537/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wms2537","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Quantum3-Labs/ARBuilder/commits/90dfe032562944259d6f7260d309ce305b0dbb0a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-07T17:13:24Z","email":"weimengsoh0827@gmail.com","name":"wms2537"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-07T17:13:24Z","email":"weimengsoh0827@gmail.com","name":"wms2537"},"message":"fix: ERC-20 deploy script, inline token approval, anytrust reads deployment.json\n\n1. ERC-20 token deployment: orchestrator generates contracts/TestToken.sol\n   (OpenZeppelin ERC-20) + scripts/deploy-test-token.sh (Foundry-based)\n   when custom gas token is requested\n\n2. Inline token approval: deploy-rollup V2/V3 templates now include\n   erc20Abi + allowance check + approve(RollupCreator, maxUint256)\n   directly in the script when nativeToken is set — no separate step\n\n3. configure-anytrust.ts: reads SequencerInbox from deployment.json\n   instead of using 0x000... placeholder. Includes BLS keygen command\n   and validates dacMembers array is not empty before proceeding","tree":{"sha":"2910b7a3071052be84ec07632463bfadd26a1219","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Quantum3-Labs/ARBuilder/git/trees/2910b7a3071052be84ec07632463bfadd26a1219"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Quantum3-Labs/ARBuilder/git/commits/90dfe032562944259d6f7260d309ce305b0dbb0a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/51080539?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wms2537/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wms2537/followers","following_url":"https://