g reviewer issues addressed:\n\n1. Package rename: @arbitrum/orbit-sdk → @arbitrum/chain-sdk (all files)\n2. Docker image: v3.5.3-rc.1 → offchainlabs/nitro-node:v3.9.7-75e084e\n3. DAS: uses same nitro-node image with entrypoint /usr/local/bin/daserver,\n   user: root for volume permissions\n4. Token approval: new scripts/approve-token.ts generated when nativeToken\n   is set — checks allowance, approves RollupCreator with correct address\n5. Custom gas token template: now includes RollupCreator lookup, allowance\n   check, deployment.json output, and ERC-20 deploy guidance\n6. BLS keygen: datool keygen command added to AnyTrust docker-compose,\n   workflow steps, and ask_orbit knowledge bases\n7. manage-validators: reads deployment.json for rollup/sequencerInbox\n8. --node.dangerous.no-sequencer-coordinator for single-node testnet\n9. deployedAtBlock saved from tx receipt in V2/V3 deploy templates","tree":{"sha":"befd1fb5b8aa26ef15181d3a5085c5e632ce9c75","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Quantum3-Labs/ARBuilder/git/trees/befd1fb5b8aa26ef15181d3a5085c5e632ce9c75"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Quantum3-Labs/ARBuilder/git/commits/ff06a92db775f3f3b800645fa5e501d78497c1d1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/51080539?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wms2537/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wms2537/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wms2537/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wms2537/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/wms2537","id":51080539,"login":"wms2537","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxMDgwNTM5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wms2537/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wms2537/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wms2537/repos","site_admin":false