0128131963c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Quantum3-Labs/ARBuilder/commits/a34befcc0405f8673c24658cb41540128131963c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/51080539?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wms2537/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wms2537/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wms2537/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wms2537/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/wms2537","id":51080539,"login":"wms2537","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxMDgwNTM5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wms2537/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wms2537/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wms2537/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wms2537/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wms2537/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wms2537","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Quantum3-Labs/ARBuilder/commits/1b9b258a54528da8c1789447e97a6be5df15ff50/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-07T05:00:35Z","email":"weimengsoh0827@gmail.com","name":"wms2537"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-07T05:00:35Z","email":"weimengsoh0827@gmail.com","name":"wms2537"},"message":"feat: wire M4 Orbit tools into MCP endpoint + refactor fix pipeline\n\nMCP endpoint (mcp/route.ts):\n- Register all 5 Orbit tools in TOOLS array and handleToolCall switch\n- Clients now see 19 tools via tools/list (was 14)\n- Server version 1.2.0 → 1.3.0\n\nOrbit deployment v2.1 vs v3.1:\n- Split DEPLOY_ROLLUP_TEMPLATE into V2 and V3 variants\n- v3.1 (BoLD): deployFactoriesToL2, assertion staking\n- v2.1 (classic): rollupCreatorAddressOverride, 0.1 ETH baseStake\n- Version-specific logs, env vars, and deployment notes\n- Python tool applies version-specific substitutions\n\nFix pipeline refactor:\n- Consolidate system prompts into STYLUS_COMPILATION_RULES + STYLUS_REFERENCE_CODE\n- Refactor validateAndFixCode into 6-phase architecture (TS + Python)\n- N57: .as_u64()/.as_u32()/.as_u128() → .to::<u64>()/etc.\n- N58: camelCase shorthand struct init → explicit field: snake_case\n- Fix test_templates for 7 templates + StakingRewards routing","tree":{"sha":"f9231ccf9a9bb7bcb02db9ffe7b67734e77408a8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Quantum3-Labs/ARBuilder/git/trees/f9231ccf9a9bb7bcb02db9ffe7b67734e77408a8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Quantum3-Labs/ARBuilder/git/commits/1b9b258a54528da8c1789447e97a6be5df15ff50","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/51080539?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wms2537/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wms2537/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wms2537/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wms2537/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/wms2537","id":51080539,"login":"wms2537","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxMDgwNTM5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wms2537/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wms2537/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wms2537/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wms2537/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wms2537/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wms2537","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Quantum3-Labs/ARBuilder/commit/1b9b258a54528da8c1789447e97a6be5df15ff50","node_id":"C_kwDOQwYCQdoAKDFiOWIyNThhNTQ1MjhkYThjMTc4OTQ0N2U5N2E2YmU1ZGYxNWZmNTA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Quantum3-Labs/ARBuilder/commit/b79e2b7eeb0ff3add573bd412749bbcd22db6b62","sha":"b79e