https://github.com/wms2537","id":51080539,"login":"wms2537","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxMDgwNTM5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wms2537/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wms2537/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wms2537/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wms2537/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wms2537/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wms2537","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Quantum3-Labs/ARBuilder/commits/4a129d2110aa3de4973f681dbf2c611389ea834f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-05T14:47:23Z","email":"weimengsoh0827@gmail.com","name":"wms2537"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-05T14:47:23Z","email":"weimengsoh0827@gmail.com","name":"wms2537"},"message":"feat: StakingRewards template + unified accessor normalization (N28/N52)\n\n1. New StakingRewards template (2.8K chars vs DeFiVault''s 4.7K):\n   - Focused on staking patterns: #[payable], transfer_eth, block_timestamp\n   - No sol_interface! or cross-contract calls (not needed for staking)\n   - Routes \"stake/staking/unstake/reward\" keywords to this template\n   - Reduces prompt size by ~40%, directly addresses N28 empty LLM responses\n\n2. Unified accessor normalization (replaces scattered Fix 47 + Fix 34):\n   - Fix 47 rewritten: strip .get(key) before .getter( chains (N52 fix)\n   - Fix 34 enhanced: Pass 3 appends .get_string() to bare .getter(k)\n     on string mapping fields after Fix 47 strips the .get(k) prefix\n   - Cleanup: doubled .get_string() chains caught by simplified regex\n   - Type-aware: only string mapping fields get .get_string() appended\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8c21eb286453d088e01eed619b6a58d6a9399742","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Quantum3-Labs/ARBuilder/git/trees/8c21eb286453d088e01eed619b6a58d6a93997