nts","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wms2537/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wms2537/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wms2537/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wms2537","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Quantum3-Labs/ARBuilder/commits/5829681fd391048c0be1983f5870a2b5dbf859c2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-04T06:22:02Z","email":"weimengsoh0827@gmail.com","name":"wms2537"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-04T06:22:02Z","email":"weimengsoh0827@gmail.com","name":"wms2537"},"message":"fix: extend Fix 27 to cover .getter().setter() pattern (N40)\n\n.getter() also returns immutable StorageGuard like .get() — can''t\ncall .setter() through it. Extended Fix 27 to transform both:\n  .get(k1).setter(k2) → .setter(k1).setter(k2)\n  .getter(k1).setter(k2) → .setter(k1).setter(k2)\n\nAlso updated system prompt rule 49 and ERROR_GUIDANCE to explicitly\nwarn against .getter().setter() pattern.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d0084fd9882fa5d9cd0e994d0d86de0db1274392","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Quantum3-Labs/ARBuilder/git/trees/d0084fd9882fa5d9cd0e994d0d86de0db1274392"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Quantum3-Labs/ARBuilder/git/commits/5829681fd391048c0be1983f5870a2b5dbf859c2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/51080539?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wms2537/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wms2537/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wms2537/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wms2537/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/wms2537","id":51080539,"login":"wms2537","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUx