e)\n  StorageMap has no .set(k,v) — must use .setter(k).set(v)\n  (Test 1.4 Staking regression)\n\nFix 47: .get(key).getter(key) → .getter(key).get_string()\n  Double key access on mapping(... => string) — LLM confuses\n  .get() and .getter()\n  (Test 1.3 NFT Registry regression)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"05bd371882c2d878c83b099fb8c5fd20e21b0194","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Quantum3-Labs/ARBuilder/git/trees/05bd371882c2d878c83b099fb8c5fd20e21b0194"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Quantum3-Labs/ARBuilder/git/commits/45c8da270cdec76243a73d004af28bfa76c8ac92","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/51080539?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wms2537/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wms2537/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wms2537/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wms2537/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/wms2537","id":51080539,"login":"wms2537","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxMDgwNTM5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wms2537/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wms2537/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wms2537/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wms2537/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wms2537/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wms2537","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Quantum3-Labs/ARBuilder/commit/45c8da270cdec76243a73d004af28bfa76c8ac92","node_id":"C_kwDOQwYCQdoAKDQ1YzhkYTI3MGNkZWM3NjI0M2E3M2QwMDRhZjI4YmZhNzZjOGFjOTI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Quantum3-Labs/ARBuilder/commit/7b8d58f02f8c48e17f14de243789ef88d43969b2","sha":"7b8d58f02f8c48e17f14de2437