rbit: Orbit chain Q&A with curated knowledge base and optional RAG\n- orchestrate_orbit: Full project scaffolding with all deployment scripts\n\nNew templates in orbit_templates.py:\n- Chain Config, Deploy Rollup, Deploy Token Bridge, Custom Gas Token\n- Validator Management, Governance, Node Config, AnyTrust Config\n- Orchestration (package.json, tsconfig, .env, setup.sh, deploy.sh)\n\nRegistration: tools registered in __init__.py and server.py with full\ninputSchema definitions. Templates exported via templates/__init__.py.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"974d9925dc31ef5e302527b60d4d3d68bb75268b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Quantum3-Labs/ARBuilder/git/trees/974d9925dc31ef5e302527b60d4d3d68bb75268b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Quantum3-Labs/ARBuilder/git/commits/f7a596b3f8b43189aab7001dea81bede12734d2b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/51080539?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wms2537/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wms2537/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wms2537/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wms2537/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/wms2537","id":51080539,"login":"wms2537","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxMDgwNTM5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wms2537/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wms2537/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wms2537/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wms2537/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wms2537/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wms2537","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Quantum3-Labs/ARBuilder/commit/f7a596b3f8b43189aab700